window.products.push({"id":185010,"name":"Sweetnight Queen Mattress in a Box, 10\" Gel Infused Queen Memory Foam Mattress, Flippable Mattress with Three Firmnesses Levels, Queen Size Bed Mattre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":352.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oy1iyR0lS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Choose Sweetnight Gel-Infused Memory Foam Mattress? ❤ Three Firmness Levels in One Mattress ❤ The bottom side offers a firm feeling, which is perfect for those who have back and shoulder problems. The top side offers a soft feeling at the head and a medium-firm feeling at the tail. ❤ Two Sides Available for Different Needs ❤ The flippable design allows you to choose the firmness that suits you best. You can flip the mattress according to your needs. ❤ Curve Memory Foam for Targeted Spinal Support ❤ The memory foam is designed with a curved shape to offer you targeted support to keep your spine in a neutral position. Sweetnight mattress will help you to wake up full of energy in the morning instead of with body aches. ❤ Temperature Adaptive for Cool Sleep ❤ Gel-infused memory foam will regulate your body temperature to give you cooler temperatures while you sleep at night. You won't wake up sweaty and drenched anymore! ❤ One-Piece Cover and Wave Pattern Make Your Home More Advanced ❤ We adopt a one-piece cover that is treated with a new process for this mattress instead of the traditional craft. The wave-pattern jacquard design makes the mattress more elegant and three-dimensional. ❤ Safe with Certification ❤ Sweetnight mattress is made of eco-friendly memory foam which is CertiPUR-US certified. It's safe and healthy for your kids and family. ❤ Professional Customer Service Team and 10-Year Warranty ❤ Sweetnight is equipped with a professional customer service team and our mattresses come with a 10-year warranty. For any problems you may have, please feel free to contact us. What is in the box? 1x Sweetnight 10 Inch Queen Mattress 1x Sweetnight Sleep Opener 1x Manual Card Mattress Sizes Availability: 8\" Twin: 75\"L x 39\"W x 8\"H 8\" Full: 75\"L x 54\"W x 8\"H 8\" Queen: 80\"L x 60\"W x 8\"H 10\" Twin: 75\"L x 39\"W x 10\"H 10\" Full: 75\"L x 54\"W x 10\"H 10\" Queen: 80\"L x 60\"W x 10\"H 10\" King: 80\"L x 76\"W x 10\"H 12\" Full: 75\"L x 54\"W x 12\"H 12\" Queen: 80\"L x 60\"W x 12\"H 12\" King: 80\"L x 76\"W x 12\"H Tips for Unpacking: ①Place your mattress wherever you intend to sleep and unbox it. ②Position your mattress on any solid base and cut the outer plastic with Sweetnight opener. ③Roll out the compressed mattress and allow it to fully inflate for about 72 hours. ④Enjoy and sleep tight with your Sweetnight. Note: - Do not be alarmed, if it has a slight odor. It is normal with new foam. Let the mattress air out for 3 days would be helpful. - Everyone's idea of firmness varies. We recommend sleeping on this mattress for a few weeks in order to give your mattress a chance to“break-in” to the way you sleep. If you still can't sleep well, please feel free to contact us at any time, we always standby to assist as you're our much-valued customer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oy1iyR0lS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweetnight","source_asin":"B0BY49BGGD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY49BGGD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY49BGGD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
