window.products.push({"id":185041,"name":"United States American Flag Blanket - Gift Soft Tapestry Throw Woven from Cotton - Made in The USA (69x48)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v5N5CqFAL._AC_SL1076_.jpg","description":"The American Flag is the most widely recognized symbol of freedom, national pride and history. Our 100% Cotton, and American Made, American Flag Blanket is respectfully woven with pride, attention to detail, and a strong commitment to quality. Triple layer woven on our Jacquard looms for extra thickness, softness and warmth. Show, or share, your patriotism and pride with this beautifully woven version of our stars and stripes. Available in Full Size, 443-A, Mini, 453-A, Pillow, 453-P. Check www.finearttapestries.com for our American Flag Wall Tapestry, 4296-WHSpecificationsThis Afghan is 50 inches wide by 70 inches tall, and is woven from 100% cotton.Pure Country WeaversWe are the world’s largest weaver of expertly crafted throw blankets, pillows, tote bags, and wall tapestries. Pure Country Weavers is dedicated to providing artisan quality home décor items to boutique stores worldwide. Soft to the touch and providing a warm, welcoming embrace, our blankets bring comfort to our clientele all over the world. Our Jacquard woven blankets are available in thousands of designs including over 200 breeds of Dogs, Cats, Horses and other animals. We are licensed to weave for over 500 Colleges, Universities, Fraternities and Sororities, We offer woven art depicting everything from Angels to Zebras. There is something here for everyone. All of our Pure Country Weavers designs are woven in the USA using advanced Jacquard weaving techniques, allowing us to generate a depth and texture not found in traditional home decor.· SOFT & BEAUTIFUL: Curl up in comfort with our super soft woven throw blanket. A perfect gift.· WOVEN NOT PRINTED: Woven from 8 miles of pure sustainably sourced American-grown cotton.· VERSATILE & STURDY: Our throws are large enough for a queen bed and perfect for naps on the sofa.· WASHER AND DRYER SAFE: Before leaving the mill our throws are pre-washed and dried so they will never shrink or fade.· AMERICAN MADE & FAMILY OWNED: Our throws are woven in our small family-owned mill located in the foothills of the Blue Ridge Mountains.· Carefully woven to ensure softness, rich texture and durability","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v5N5CqFAL._AC_SL1076_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pure Country Weavers","source_asin":"B08ZVNBHMN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZVNBHMN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZVNBHMN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
