window.products.push({"id":185090,"name":"REGAL 300TC Standard Ivory 100% Cotton Pillowcases","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Y4H5XD6KL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description These 100% cotton sateen woven pillowcases of 300 thread counts per square inch create a wonderful luxurious sleep. They are soft and sliky and continue to get softer after each washing. Being 100% cotton makes them naturally breaheable. . Each set comes with a pair of pillowcases. Amazon.com Affordable, durable, and softly comfortable, this pair of 100 percent cotton, 300-thread-count Standard-sized pillowcases is great for use every night or as a second set for the guest room. They feature an ivory hue and a sateen fabric weave, which places more yarn surface on the face of the cloth, giving it a glossy, satin-like sheen. And because they're made from 100 percent cotton, these sheets and pillowcases are nicely breathable and will get softer with each washing. Machine wash in warm water with similar colors (no bleach) for best results.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Y4H5XD6KL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REGAL","source_asin":"B000CBUT6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185090","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000CBUT6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000CBUT6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":185091,"name":"Dishwasher Magnet, Clean Dirty Sign Indicator for Dishwasher Easy to Read and Strong Slide for Changing Signs, Sleek Design, Heavy Duty Magnet with Op","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h-rtPKUES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Plastic 🌟 SUPERIOR QUALITY DISHWASHER MAGNET - Our Dishwasher Magnet is made of materials that are second-to-none and has an attractive silver finish. It measures 7 x 2 x 0.5 inches and weighs just 2.2 ounces. 🌟 ADHERES TO ANY DISHWASHER - Our dishwasher sign has a super strong magnet on the backside and includes self-adhesive sticker for non-magnetic dishwashers, so it will stay in place undoubtedly! The options of affixing the sign make it super easy to set it up on any dishwasher on the market! 🌟 ERGONOMIC DESIGN - Tired of the problem of whether the dishes are dirty or clean? Eureka! When the dishes are clean, simply swipe the indicator to notify others in the household. Our dishwasher magnet features a strong sliding mechanism with bold and clear text so you can read it from a distance, which makes the use of this magnetic sign oh-so-comfortable! 🌟 A GREAT GIFT CHOICE - Go for the design! Our pretty dishwasher magnet, wrapped in its beautiful packaging, would be an awesome gift for your mom/dad, wife/husband, sibling, best friend or just anyone! Great for birthdays, housewarming, Christmas, graduation and much more. 🌟 OUR PROMISE TO YOU - We got you covered! Your purchase includes a hassle-free 30 day Money Back Guarantee. If you don't like your brand new Dishwasher Magnet simply return them for a FULL REFUND - no questions asked. Try yours now RISK-FREE with our Money Back Guarantee!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h-rtPKUES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sperric","source_asin":"B0B33PKF9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185091","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B33PKF9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B33PKF9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":185092,"name":"Lost & Found by Philippe Sainte-Laudy Hanging Art Piece, 22\"x32\" Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.24,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pxppxYOlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features orange Leaves with a single red Leaf in the middle. Photographer by passion for years, Philippe took an immediate liking to photographing landscape and nature. Always in search of the best light and the most original angle, he maintains a constant search for the most beautiful places surrounding him. Philippe prides himself in understanding the complex interactions between light, weather, landscape, the tides, plants and animals. He finds it is important to have a deep respect for this planet and its inhabitants. Philippe hopes that his photography can bring people closer to nature and encourage them to preserve it for future generations. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pxppxYOlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B0130H28WM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185092","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0130H28WM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0130H28WM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":185093,"name":"Breezewell Portable Mini fan, 3 In 1 Evaporative Air Cooler & Humidifier, 2000mAH Battery Powered, USB Rechargeable, w/3 Wind Speeds, Small Swamp Cool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7175+kBlCRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❆【3-IN-1 Fan/Humidifier/Cooler】BREEZEWELL desk fan offers multiple functions as a fan, humidifier, and cooler all in one. It provides various options to cater to your diverse requirements in different scenarios. During winter, it can be used to humidify the air. In moderately hot weather, it functions as a conventional fan. If you add water and ice to the top tank, it produces a cold wind. However, please note that it can only cool a personal space the size of a bed and not an entire room. ❄【USB Charging & Wireless Use】The small air cooler is equipped with a 2000mAh rechargeable battery that allows for a prolonged cooling experience. It can be used wirelessly for up to 3-5 hours once fully charged. Additionally, the package comes with a 6.56FT USB-Type C charging cord that can be connected to an adapter, power bank, computer, or car charger, making it convenient for you to charge it anywhere and at any time. ❄【265ml Water Tank for Extra Cooling】The personal fan has a 265ml water tank that operates for 3-5 hours when filled (runtime depends on ambient humidity). It automatically switches to natural wind mode when the water runs out for a peaceful sleep. The water level window lets you monitor the level and the top water tank design simplifies filling and prevents leakage. ❄【Portable & Compact Design】The portable fan is designed to be compact, measuring only 5.9*6.3*6.9 inches, making it suitable for use in tight spaces while providing limitless usage possibilities. The lightweight and compact design allows for easy transportation and storage when not in use. It weighs only 2.23 lbs, which is equivalent to the weight of three apples. As such, you can easily carry it in your bag wherever you go, be it for picnics, RV trips, fishing, golfing, or even in your garage. ❄【Sensitive Button Controls】The BREEZEWELL mini fan has user-friendly button controls for adjusting the three wind speed settings (Low/Mid/High) and mist settings. It also features a built-in 3 LED indicator that provides the necessary information to operate the device effectively. The icons are easy to understand, making them user-friendly for seniors unfamiliar with smart appliances. If you have any questions, feel free to contact us via Amazon, and we'll respond within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7175+kBlCRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BREEZEWELL","source_asin":"B0BVF5ZB4C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVF5ZB4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVF5ZB4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
