window.products.push({"id":185100,"name":"Duraflame Electric Fireplace Stove 1500 Watt Infrared Heater with Flickering Flame Effects - Cream","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z3FPfqoDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The cream Duraflame Infrared Electric Fireplace Stove is easily portable, creates a life-like flame effect and produces the right amount of heat for virtually any room. The classically styled stove creates the look of a wood burning stove, but without any of the hassles or inconveniences. Creating a life-like, flickering flame effect, this stove will help you relax the second you plug it in and turn it on. The infrared heater supplements heat for rooms up to 1,000 Sq. Ft. - nearly double the amount of heat output compared to traditional fan-forced heaters. As a standalone heater, it will heat rooms up to 400 Sq. Ft. The heater and flame effects are independent of one another meaning you can enjoy the flames without heat during the warmer months and then when it gets cooler, you can have the flames with heat. Safe for kids and pets - stays cool to the touch. Requires no venting or gas lines. Includes an owner's manual and remote control with 2 AAA batteries. CSA safety certified.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z3FPfqoDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duraflame","source_asin":"B012O7VLWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012O7VLWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B012O7VLWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":185101,"name":"nambe Chili Pepper Figurine | New Mexico Pepper Sculpture Home Décor | Small Figurines Desktop, Kitchen, and Bookshelf Decoration | Made of Metal Allo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w9kF6S4AS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Namb 's hot Chile Pepper paperweight is organically designed and can give many messages. Used to make a statement for personal or corporate gift giving. Amazon.com Anyone enchanted by the Southwest and who in particular owns up to a gastronomic fondness for the famous red and green chilis of New Mexico, would get a kick out of this sculpted chili pepper. Handcrafted of a gleaming metal alloy, the pepper is realistically rendered right down to its curves, dimples, and stem. Gift-boxed and engraved with the prestigious Nambé name, the chili pepper measures approximately six inches in length and makes a unique paperweight for the office or year-round ornament for the home. The pepper is easily cleaned by hand. Nambé was founded in 1951 in a village of the same name in scenic northern New Mexico. From the beginning, the company has focused on hand-producing high-quality, functional metal items such as bowls and trays with great attention to timeless, modern design. Still made in the USA, Nambé's signature metal alloy is liquified, poured into a hand-made sand cast, and the resulting piece repeatedly polished and smoothed by hand. Exceptional gifts for the most special of occasions, Nambé metal bowls and accessories are now joined by porcelain and crystal pieces, each flawlessly crafted. Nambé ware has won numerous design awards, has been shown in or recognized by nearly two dozen museums worldwide, and is part of the permanent collections of many, including the Museum of Modern Art in New York. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w9kF6S4AS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nambe","source_asin":"B000VXP82Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VXP82Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VXP82Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
