window.products.push({"id":185228,"name":"BONECO Cool Mist Ultrasonic Humidifier 7145","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lh38ImjuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This compact Ultrasonic Humidifier provides optimal humidification, both in the office and at home. An integrated hygrostat lets you set the desired humidity – the mist output therefore adjusts itself automatically. The humidity level can be specifically controlled at all times by means of a variable control. As soon as the water in the tank has been used up, an empty indicator comes on. The mist can be distributed in two directions using the double jet nozzle. Additional features: Practical reminder indicator for refilling water, easy handling and cleaning, double jet nozzle, high quality components, includes essential water maintenance accessories (Hydro Cell, Demineralization cartridge and EZCal).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lh38ImjuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BONECO","source_asin":"B001GSZBEA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001GSZBEA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001GSZBEA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":185229,"name":"Gee Di Moda Rectangle Tablecloth - 90 x 132 Inch - Red Rectangular Table Cloth for 6 Foot Table in Washable Polyester - Great for Buffet Table, Partie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XGmqBtoJL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Cover any table with stylish sophistication. Bring practical elegance to all your common surfaces with the Polyester Tablecloth by Gee Di Moda. This 90 by 132-inch cloth provides ample coverage for all your standard 6-foot rec tables, buffet tables, dining room tables, and beyond. Featuring a variety of brilliant colors across the rainbow spectrum, our line of premium tablecloths offers chic, affordable flair for every holiday party or dinner. Enjoy hassle free cleanup with strong, durable, wrinkle and stain resistant polyester, while a 30” drop helps block spills from damaging your expensive tabletop, chairs and rug. For all your birthday, holiday, wedding, and Sunday dinner get-togethers, depend on Gee Di Moda for stunning design and fabulous functionality. Ideal Rectangular Shape Accommodate the majority of buffet and dining room tables with a perfectly oblong cover. Whether indoors or outdoors, dress up your folding tables for a dash of decorative elegance. Durable Polyester Never worry about ironing or dry cleaning again. Strong fabric material repels liquid, launders in the washing machine, and remains wrinkle-free for many years to come. It’s also classier than vinyl. Elegant Design One-piece seamless construction brings a crisp, chic look to your wedding buffet, Thanksgiving dinner table, or backyard affair. Carefully folded and hemmed edges flow 30” from the table for added protection. Affordable & Hard Wearing Don’t waste money on junky disposable tablecloths. These pretty covers are available in convenient sizes and won’t fade, tear, or pill after repeated use. Use for kids’ parties and other fun, messy functions. Colorful Variety Choose from classic muted designs in beige, ivory, white, and black, or go bold with a vibrant red, royal blue, purple, and many more. Gee Di Moda specializes in popular wedding shades to match any motif.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XGmqBtoJL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gee Di Moda","source_asin":"B01KGIGQ2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KGIGQ2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KGIGQ2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
