window.products.push({"id":185231,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner for Personal with 3 Wind Speeds,Mini Air Cooler Fan,USB Air Personal Conditioner with 7 Colour LED Lights,Small Air Condition","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mt+p3ke1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Portable Air Conditioner-- A comfortable and natural way to keep you stay cool this summer! Operating the Portable Air Conditioner: 1.Place the Portable Air Conditioner on a horizontal table. 2.Open the lid. 3.Add pure water or mineral water(Don’t add water higher than the maximum water level). 4.Remove the filter.For better cooling,you might use a few crushed ice. 5.Connect the charging port on the air conditioner. 6.Press the power button to turn on,enjoy the cool life brought by the portable air conditioner. Note: 📣 For best cooling effect,the recommended environment temperature is above 77°F.The drier the environment is,the stronger the effect is. 📣 Please use a data cable or power adapter with a rated voltage and current of 5V and 2A to connect the portable air conditoner,otherwise it may cause the motor to malfunction or performance degradation. 📣 Place the portable air conditioner on a flat platform when filling water,don’t tilt it.Please observe the water level perspective window and don’t make the water surface exceed the highest water mark F position. 📣 After the portable air conditioner is filled with water,it should remain stable while moving and cannot be tilted. 📣 When the portable air conditioner is not used for a long time,please empty and dry the water tank,remove the nano filter element and dry it. Recommendations: ✔ Optimal use distance:11.8-31.5 IN ✔ Best environmental experience:temperature above  77°F ✔ The cooling effect is inversely proportional to the humidity. ✔ The drier the environment is,the stronger the effect is. Specification: Product Name: Portable Air Conditioner Color: Black Size: 7.48*7.48*7.67IN Charging method: USB Water Tank Capacity: 500ml Continuous Humidification Time: 8h Wind Speed: 3 gears adjustable Function: cold wind, humidification, air purification","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mt+p3ke1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geohee","source_asin":"B0C6B4TMVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185231","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6B4TMVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6B4TMVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":185232,"name":"Antallcky Round Cookie Cutter Set-12 Pack Stainless Steel Nest Circle Biscuit Molds Fondant Cake Cookie Cutter Set Pastry Ring Mold Diameter from-0.9 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WnBfT649L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"MADE OF PREMIUM STAINLESS STEEL: all 100% commercial 18/8 304 stainless steel making them strong so they keep their shape, are rust proof, dishwasher safe and tested to be oven safe to 500F degrees.Choose 1 or 2 cutters,perfectly for making round or annulus cookies,fruits,vegetables, fondant,bread,sandwiches,cheese,craft clay or others.Great for round linzer cookies and round cookies (covering images).microwave oven, oven,refrigerator, and electric baking pan,-40℃-230℃ generally. GREAT FOR FRUITS, VEGGIES, AND CHEESE: These incredibly sharp one-sided cutters are made of heavy-duty materials that cut easily through fruits, vegetables, and hard cheeses. Use these cutters to create beautiful platters or stack them for a breathtaking fruit or vegetable tower presentation. MAKE PERFECTLY ROUND PASTRIES: These cutters have been triple-tested to ensure that each and every one of them are perfectly round. No more misshapen cookies! Their rims have been double- sharpened so that the dough slips easily off the cutter for the pan and maintains a sharp, clean edge. This will prevent any warping of the dough, ensuring that the dough remains a perfect, professional circle. DISHWASHER SAFE: Never wash a dish! Due to the premium stainless steel used in manufacturing this product, these cutters are perfectly safe for running through the dishwasher, saving you the most time-consuming and annoying part of baking – the cleanup. Made of 18/8 304 premium stainless steel, these ring cutters will not rust, and that’s a guarantee.Dishwasher safe and tested to be oven safe to 500F degrees. 12 GRADUATED SIZES: Making doughnuts or linzer cookies? Love pierogis? Whether you choose to use them for traditional round cookies, or something more exotic like empanadas or ravioli, round cutters are one of the most indispensable cooking gadgets around. 12 cutters diameters from small to large is:0.9\",1.2\",1.6\",2,2\".3,2\".6,3\",3.2\",3.5\",3.8\",4.1\",4.4in (2.4,3.2,4.1,5,5.8,6.7,7.5,8.2,8.9,9.7,10.5,11.3cm),all depths are 1.2\"(3.2cm).More Choice and experience easier deep cut.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WnBfT649L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Antallcky","source_asin":"B0821NJTB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0821NJTB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0821NJTB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":185233,"name":"Extremus Deluge Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Sports Water Bottle with 100% Leak-Proof Travel Lid, w/Paracord Survival Handle, 40 oz, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VGDs+KkuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEY FEATURES – Triple insulated vacuum sealed double wall – 100% leak proof – BPA-Free – Survival handle with Made in USA military grade paracord – Heavy duty 550lb carabiner – Dishwasher safe (SOLID COLORS ONLY) – Available in American born Prym1 patterns TRIPLE-INSULATED – The Extremus Deluge Stainless steel sports bottles have a 3.5mm vacuum space, sealed by double walls of food grade 304 stainless steel with a layer of copper coating to insulate hot or cold beverages from the outer surface. This superior triple-insulated design helps to preserve hot beverages up to 12 hours or cold beverages up to 24 hours. Great as a travel mug! 100% LEAK PROOF BPA-FREE LID – The wide mouth screw on cap with integrated smaller screw on drinking cap is ideal for hot or cold liquids and is 100% leak proof. Our wide mouth water bottle cap provides plenty of access for no-hassle cleaning and the tethered smaller drinking cap means no more lost water bottle caps. The Deluge cap is molded with safe non-toxic BPA-free material for exceptional durability. PARACORD SURVIVAL HANDLE – The Deluge includes a removable survival paracord handle and a heavy duty 550lb carabiner. The Extremus paracord has a tensile strength of 550lbs, making Deluge the ideal sports bottle for not only the gym and everyday use but also unexpected survival situations. DISHWASHER SAFE (SOLID COLORS ONLY) – The Extremus Deluge wide mouth sports bottle is easy to keep clean by hand, and the solid color bottles are also dishwasher safe. Be sure to wash the Deluge before initial use. For a thorough cleaning, remove gasket and seals from the lid and hand wash with a mild dish soap and warm water. Stay hydrated no matter where you go with the Extremus Deluge sports bottle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VGDs+KkuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Extremus","source_asin":"B0BJ74P24B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ74P24B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ74P24B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
