window.products.push({"id":185285,"name":"4 PCS Adjustable Threaded Bed Frame Anti-Shake Tool,Headboard Stoppers Fixer with Anti-Shake Hex Nut,Bedside Antishake Telescopic Support Stabilizer f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PqRpUhjeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you still worried about your bed and furniture shaking? Furniture will not only make noise, but also damage the furniture itself due to frequent shaking. Just install our bed frame anti-shake tool to solve your furniture creaking problem. It can effectively reduce noise, prevent shaking, calm mood and improve sleep quality. Used in places where the center of gravity is unstable or easy to shake, such as beds, cabinets, chairs, and sofas. How to install the headboard anti-shake: 1. Put a sticker on the metal head 2. Tear off the film and stick it on the wall 3. Stick the EVA pad on the rubber head 4. Paste it in a suitable position and fix it after rotating the nut We strongly recommend that you use 4 sets of adjustable threaded bed frame anti-shake tools, 2 sets at the top of the bed to prevent shaking, and 2 sets at the bottom to prevent movement. Material: metal and EVA. quantity. 4 sets The package includes: 4 PCS x round EVA anti-skid pads 8PCS x adjustable screw 4PCS x 3M double-sided sticker Precautions. There are small parts in the package, please keep away from children. hint： 1. Measure the distance between your shaky furniture and the wall before buying, then choose the right size. 2. Due to manual measurement, there may be an error.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PqRpUhjeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tivcck","source_asin":"B0B42S21Q9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B42S21Q9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B42S21Q9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
