window.products.push({"id":185492,"name":"100% Pure Beeswax Handmade Taper Candles (Coconut Cream) - 10 Inch Smokeless Dripless Pair - Natural Subtle Honey Smell - Elegant Honeycomb Design — b","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717RI1jcN3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beeswax is the only naturally existing wax on earth and is a completely renewable resource. The bright flame of a beeswax candle releases the scent of honey and the nectar of flowers in a honeycomb. When a beeswax candle burns, it emits the same beautiful light spectrum as the sun, along with negative ions that clean the air of dust and fine particles. Negative ions are drawn to positive ions. Positive ions hold on to airborne things like dust, mold and odors; the negative ions latch on to the “contaminated” positive ions and weigh them down. This causes the contaminated positive ions to fall to the ground, cleaning and purifying the air. A perfect example of this phenomenon is rainstorms. A rainstorm is a negative ionic event, which is why we say the air smells so fresh after a rainstorm. Our candles are dyed for a holiday atmosphere, and emit a subtle, gentle burn with a clean, stable flame once the wick reaches the wax. Our candles are clean and environmentally friendly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717RI1jcN3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UnBeelievable","source_asin":"B078V76T99","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078V76T99","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078V76T99","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
