window.products.push({"id":185527,"name":"Coffee Maker, Stainless Steel Moka Coffee Pot Percolator Stovetop Espresso Latte Maker Percolator Stove Top Filter Coffee Maker Pot Easy Clean (300ML ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Gw9mXyGEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Description: Our mocha pot is made of high-quality stainless steel material, safe and healthy, sturdy and durable to use. It is very easy and convenient to use, and it works fast for just a few minutes. And it has exquisite appearance and ergonomic handle design, 4 different sizes could be selected for you. Such a nice and practical mocha pot, you're worth it. How To Use: 1. Filling the base pot with cold water just below the valve. 2. Inserting the funnel and fill it with ground (do not tamp), remove any coffee grounds on the edge of the funnel. 3. Tightly screw the upper part of the pot on the base, avoid using the handle for leverage. 4. Selecting cooking appliance to fit the bottom of pot. 5. Putting the pot on the cooking appliance, when there's coffee overflow from the top pot, remove the pot from the cooking appliance Specifications: Condition: 100% Brand New Material: Stainless steel Color: Silver 100ml Pot Size: Approx. 6.3 x 8 x 15cm / 2.5 x 3.1 x 6inch 200ml Pot Size: Approx. 6.7 x 8.5 x 17.5cm / 2.6 x 3.3 x 7inch 300ml Pot Size: Approx. 7.2 x 9.8 x 20cm / 2.8 x 3.9 x 8inch 450ml Pot Size: Approx. 8.5 x 11 x 22.5cm / 3.3 x 4.3 x 9inch Package Weight: Approx. 309g-643gCompatible with induction cooker, electric cooker, alcohol cooker Package Included: 1 x Mocha Pot Please Note: 1. Please clean it for several times before using, and after using it to make coffee, you also need to clean it and keep it clean and dry, it will be used for a longer time.  2. Please screw the upper part to base pot tightly for preventing leaking.  3. Please allow 1-3cm error due to manual measurement. Thanks for your understanding. 4. Monitors are not calibrated same, item color displayed in photos may be showing slightly different from the real object. Please take the real one as standard.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Gw9mXyGEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yosoo","source_asin":"B01NALRG5K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NALRG5K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NALRG5K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
