window.products.push({"id":185570,"name":"Sur La Table Jacques Pépin Collection Chickens Appetizer Plates 2015/19, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Kzg1uIjnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The best cooking is a happy marriage between technique and creativity, and who better to demonstrate this than Jacques Pépin? An artist both in the kitchen and in the studio, Jacques worked with us to create this exclusive collection in celebration of his truly remarkable career. Inspired by his whimsical artwork, each piece is designed to bring a bit of the art and soul of cooking to your own table. emBon appétit!/em brbrServe everything from appetizers to desserts in style with these handsome plates. Durable white earthenware plates with curvy red edges feature four unique designs based on Jacques Pépin’s chicken paintings. Pair with our coordinating linens and serveware for a delightful set that’s perfect for entertaining or everyday meals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Kzg1uIjnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sur La Table","source_asin":"B01I5VV7B6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I5VV7B6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I5VV7B6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":185571,"name":"Poo-Pourri Original 16-Ounce Refill Bottle and 1.4-Ounce Original","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mS0yFz5HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"16 ounce Refill Bottle Original Scent  1.4 ounce Original Scent Some say the secret to a happy relationship is separate bathrooms, but those people have never tried poo pourri,the classy, sassy, ultra-effective way to leave the bathroom smelling better than you found it.  And now with your new poo pourri bottles you’ll never face such problems again. One for you, and onefor your spouse to use at home, and to take along wherever you go to cover up when you go! Go ahead. Join thousands of happy customers who've tried potpourri for fun and keep using it because it reallyworks! When you spray poo pourri into the bowl before-you-go, our proprietary formula creates a protective barrieron the water's surface. This barrier is designed to trap unpleasant bathroom odors beneath the surface and keepthem out of the air. All you'll smell is a refreshing bouquet of Essential oils! You (and everyone around you) canbreathe easy with potpourri. Does more than just improve air quality - it's environmentally friendly. Our secret blendsrely on Essential oils to eliminate bathroom odors, making it safe for the planet and your septic systems. These Poo Pourri Bottles will give you the CONFIDENCE to visit the bathroom at any time, wherever you are. CONVENIENT USAGE 3-5 sprays to disperse magic ingredients. On-The-Go convenience. Up to 800 applications in the 16 ounce Refill Bottle. Keep on refilling your 1.4 oz Bottle and you’ll be safe wherever you are. A floral scent will be activated and eliminates foul odor effectively. In the end your toilet all is left with this pleasant odor. REPLACE EMBARRASSMENT WITH CONFIDENCE","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mS0yFz5HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poo-Pourri","source_asin":"B08G9PS2RL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G9PS2RL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G9PS2RL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":185572,"name":"VORCAY Cake Decorating Kits Supplies-95Pcs Baking Tools Professional Cake Turntable Stand for Beginners","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Eirc7ugmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEWEST REVOLVING CAKE TURNTABLE WITH RING BEARING:The cake turntable is made of high quality ABS,and constructed with a larger-heavier ring bearing of better quality for rotation.It has extended chassis and the non-slip silicone base.Upgrade bearing and extended chassis make the cake stand steady,spins very smoothly and makes no noise like the aluminum alloy turntable.Use the included silicone brush to clean the turntable well. BAKING CAKE DECORATING SUPPLIES:A set of baking accessories including everything you need to start baking and decorating cakes like a pro! 1 Newest Revolving Cake Turntable,2 Icing Spatula,3 Icing Smoother, 24 Numbered Cake Icing Tips with Guide,1 Reusable Silicone Pastry Bag,50 Disposable Pastry Bags,6 Mini Silicone Donut Pan,1 Cooling Rack,1 Decorating Pen,1 Cake Flower Nail and 1 Scissors,1 Egg Separator,1 Coupler,1 Icing Washing Brush,1 Silicone Cake-turner Brush,1 Icing Tips Pattern chart. 6 MINI SILICONE MOLDS:The baking cups are made of 100% food grade silicone,includes six different styles (heart, stars, flower, circle, pumpkin, spiral).Can be used for so many different desserts(doughnuts,muffins, puddings).Great for occasions of birthday party, holiday party, baby shower,or wedding.The doughnuts pan are non-stick ,heat-resistant,outside matte finishing ,inside bright finishing,cooled items pop out easily without cracking or breaking apart. STAINLESS STEEL COOLING RACK:The baking rack in black, durable steel construction with narrow grid pattern, grea tcooling racks for cookies, cupcakes, muffins, bread, cakes and more!4 stable feet keeps pastries raised above the counter air circulate underneath for proper cooling. Nonstick coating releases food easily, also easy to clean and dishwasher safe. VARIETY OF PIPING TIPS TO TRY OUT:24 icing tips with numbers and made of durable stainless steel.The cake decorating tools has guide about icing tips that can help you decide how to decorate the cake quickly.All tips and accessories can dishwasher, come with a small brush for easily hand wash. Use coupler to exchange tips without exchanging piping bags.Perfect for anyone who likes to decorate cakes, cookie, cupcakes, brownies, macaron and pastries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Eirc7ugmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VORCAY","source_asin":"B0BLSL2MTB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLSL2MTB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLSL2MTB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
