window.products.push({"id":185598,"name":"TEECK Shower Curtain Rod, 40-73 inch Adjustable Tension Spring, Shower Curtain Rod Tension, Premium Stainless Steel, Anti-Slip, No Drilling, No Rust, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UBVPPfrmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A shower curtain rod that can be used for hanging dumbbells In the past, when installing old-fashioned shower curtain rods, I needed to use an electric drill to make holes in the wall so I could insert a locked shower curtain frame. After finally putting the rod in place, the entire process required 30 minutes. Dust was strewn all throughout the bathroom floor, and I also had to clean up the bathroom.  It was not until I encountered this shower curtain rod that I found it was simply very convenient to install. In addition, it was as efficient as the shower curtain rod that required drilling holes in the wall. It only required me to slant it 5 degrees and twist the head slightly to adjust the location. Furthermore, the two end caps with silicone feet will lock the rod tightly onto the wall. And how much weight can it bear? It can be used to hang 22 pound dumbbells and will still not bend, while the end caps will not move. Of course, it is not strenuous for women to install.  Why would you still have any reason to refuse to buy this shower curtain rod? Please buy our shower curtain rod as soon as possible, and you will have an amazing product usage experience. Installation Steps Step 1: Adjust the rod length which fits your space best. Step 2: Hold the rod with both hands and push the rod out horizontally and then rotate the rod until it is 1 or 2 inches longer than the opening (depending on the size).  Step 3: Pull the extending part back to create tension and adjust the rod to the appropriate horizontal position.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UBVPPfrmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEECK","source_asin":"B08Q7WXQ9G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q7WXQ9G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q7WXQ9G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
