window.products.push({"id":185635,"name":"Bonceram Large Big Coffee Mug - 16 oz Tall Ceramic Giant Stoneware Mug with Handle, Suitable for Americano, Latte, Tea, Dishwasher Safe Mug, Honey Ora","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CW804TBlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【Big Capacity mug Fills Your Need Perfectly】At 18 ounce, this mug has a perfect size to meet your needs for office and home. coffee cups ceramic are large enough to house plenty of coffee, tea, milk, hot chocolate or any other drink you like. large coffee mugs still leaves room for the extra ice, marshmallow or caramel and also stirring them without splashing them out. 🎨【Bright Colors mug to Brighten Your Mood】This hand-glazed porcelain mug comes in 8 colors, ceramic coffee mug can be used both everyday or reserved for special occasions, and you can mix and match or grab a full set. Those lustrous mugs can brighten a kitchen—and your mood! Moreover, the bright color can stay even after daily washings in the dishwasher. ☀️【Comfortable Warming Grasp mug】This coffee mug is characterized with a smooth surface and user-friendly handle. You will find the ideal-sized handle make the mug easy to grip and feel substantial in hand. Plus, the moderate thickness of the lip fits comfortable with your mouth. This big coffee mug is so wonderfully ergonomic and sure to quickly become the large coffee cup you reach for daily. 🗝️【A Sturdy Mug Will Be With You For Years】These mugs are made from pro-grade stoneware which is fired at high temps and coated with a non-toxic glaze for extra safety and durability. There is lead-free and are dishwasher safe, plus cappuccino mug can go in the microwave too if you need to quickly warm up your beverage. 🛍️【Worthy Gift For Any Season mug】As packaged in a well-wrapped and avoid-broken box, you can gift giant mug to your beloved, friends, relative, family members and more. cute coffee mug also a nice present on occasions like Christmas, birthdays, wedding or house warming. If there is any damage in the transit, please feel free to contact us, we'll reply within 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CW804TBlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonceram","source_asin":"B08T1NX74Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T1NX74Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T1NX74Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
