window.products.push({"id":185648,"name":"Seiko QXJ019BLH Mantel Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815pME8lcmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Seiko Story From Humble beginnings, Kintaro Hattori’s Vision for Seiko has become reality. A consuming passion for excellence - imprinted in our Corporate DNA passed from generation to generation. Seiko, for 125 years committed to the art and science of time. A culture of innovation connects a 19th century Tokyo clock shop with 20th century advances in timekeeping to an extraordinary 21st century \"quiet revolution.\" Continually driven by dedication and passion, established a multitude of world’s first technologies… transforming the principles of timekeeping. The first quartz wristwatch – changed the history of time. The first Kinetic – marked a new era in quartz watch technology. In 1969, Seiko Astron, the first quartz wristwatch - was introduced. In an instant, Seiko exponentially improved the accuracy of wristwatches –And Seiko technology firmly established today’s standard in Olympic and sports timing. 1984, another celebrated first – Kinetic Technology – powered by body movement. Kinetic – a quartz mechanism with unparalleled accuracy –the driving force behind more world’s firsts. Kinetic Chronograph – the next generation of high performance timekeeping. Kinetic Auto Relay – automatically resets to the correct time. Kinetic Perpetual - combining the date perfect technology of perpetual calendar with the genius of Kinetic Auto Relay. And now Kinetic Direct Drive – move, and the watch is powered automatically. Or hand wind it and see the power you are generating in real time. In the realm of fine watches, time is measured by Seiko innovation – A heritage of dedication to the art and science of time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815pME8lcmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEIKO","source_asin":"B004JOPQZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185648","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004JOPQZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004JOPQZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":185649,"name":"Royalling Walnut Wood Serving Tray with Handle Serve Coffee Tea Cocktails Appetizers Rectangle Breakfast Bed Wood Tray Wooden Decorative Serving Tray ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T+lWz7PbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Perfect Sized】 15x11.8x1.9 (Lenth*With*Hight). Perfect Size Fit for Different Types of Tableware, 2 handles design not only looks beautiful,but also makes it more easy to grip and transport;raised edge could prevent food and plates from falling.【High-quality Walnut】 Exquisitely handcrafted with 100% natural dark walnut wood, Each tray side is Mortise and tenon joint structure. It will hold under heavy pressure, won’t pull apart and will require almost no care to keep it in durable, pristine condition for years to come.Natural Beautiful from Natural Walnut, Each One Has Its Own Unique Wood Grains. Elegant Design for your Elegant Life.【Multiple Uses】 Whether utilizing this rectangle tray as a home decor, coffee/food serving tray, ottoman tray, dinner tray or to surprise a loved one with breakfast in bed.Classic and vintage walnut serving tray, medium sized, simple and elegant design with handles in both side. Adds a touch of luxury to any kitchen, dining room, or living area. you can bring the tray from countertop to living room, from kitchen to bedroom, office to outdoor patio… anywhere you’d like!【Practical Organizer】You will need some extra space in your living room for drinks, food and odds and ends storage. Turn your ottoman into a small table, It's a perfect ottoman or a coffee table accessory. Whether you’re styling an ottoman, serving breakfast in bed, organizing your bathroom toiletries, holding TV remotes and video game controllers, or even resting plants, this tray is meant to be there for you no matter what.【Perfect Gift】 Elegant design and fine grained of each tray serves as a caring GIFT for the holidays, weddings, bridal showers, housewarming parties, anniversary, Christmas, birthdays. Bring joy and beauty to your loved ones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T+lWz7PbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROYALLING","source_asin":"B09ZRDCQSJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZRDCQSJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZRDCQSJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
