window.products.push({"id":185866,"name":"Bedemu Body Pillow Cover, Grey Body Pillow Pillowcase with Invisible Double Zipper, 100% Cotton 600 Thread Count Body Pillow Case for Adults, Easy in/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514fg7JCQ5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ULTIMATE COMFORT BODY PILLOW COVER-Add style and comfort to your sleep with bedemu body pillow pillowcase. Made from 100% cotton with a rich sateen weave for ultimate softness and comfort. You will love the soft touch and excellent breathability of this body pillow case. Naturally cool and breathable in all seasons. Keep you cool during the summer, warm in the winter. Dream off into a pleasant sleep with this body pillow case cover. INVISIBLE DOUBLE ZIPPERED CLOSURE DESIGN-The body pillow cover with zipper has two hidden zippers style, handmade and better fit. Easy in and off your pillow. make you feel rested and refreshed when you wake up every day. While fully zippered design ensures to keep the pillow inside the 20x54 body pillow cover without making it slip out when it comes in contact with your head. 100% COTTON MATERIAL & 600 THREAD COUNT- Our gray body pillow cover is made with cool & crisp 100% premium cotton with 600 thread counts. This body pillow case cover with zipper gives the extra smoothness and even surface to the fabric which feels super soft against the skin. It is much softer than others. Therefore is more pleasant to sleep on. You will feel the quality and comfort in every stitch. MACHINE WASHABLE FOR EASY CARE-Our body pillow case cover with zipper is machine wash in cold/medium temperature water, tumble dry on low. As this body pillow case is cotton material, so they might wrinkle a little, we recommend taking them out of the dyer before finishing drying, and do not use bleach to limit fading. Package Content: 1 pack 20x54 inches zippered body pillow case cover. Note: Body Pillowcase only,not include the pillow. 100% No Risk Purchase: We are so confident you will love our 20x54 body pillow cover like our other customer! If for any reason you don't love it. Please feel free to contact us via Amazon. Great to use in home, hotels, spas, and physical therapy clinics. Awesome for kid’s projects, to decorate or even embroidery on. You can even use them as chair backs! With its many uses, not just for sleeping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514fg7JCQ5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEDEMU","source_asin":"B0C1RSM1FW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1RSM1FW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1RSM1FW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
