window.products.push({"id":185964,"name":"Aoruru Electric Pancake Maker for Kids Mini Crepe Maker Nonstick Fried Eggs Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PcleBm6wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY AND CONVENIENT: Different from other pancake Pan which need to put on the gas range. This electric Pancake Maker just plug in socket then could be used directly. MULTIFUNCTION: This electric griddle could make lots of delicious food such as fruit pancake,fried eggs,round ham slices,sausage patties,mini crepes and so on. EASY CLEAN-UP: Super easy clean, just use a wet cloth on the pan everything comes right off. 7-HOLES DESIGN: Suit for big family and party, satisfy different demand. Some people like easy eggs, others like medium or scrambled eggs.You could also cook different foods at the same time. HASSLE FREE WARRANTY: We provide professional after-sales service. Please feel freely to contact us directly if you have any problem.We will solve problem in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PcleBm6wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aoruru","source_asin":"B09VSF3B6X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VSF3B6X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VSF3B6X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":185965,"name":"Velvet Hangers 20 Pack Black – Heavy Duty Velvet Clothes Hangers - Non Slip Felt Coat and Suit Hangers for Closet - Lightweight Thin Space Saving Ganc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810o1lXxmrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐ THE HANGER HAS IT'S HEYDAY! Time to celebrate the long-awaited innovation of the classic hanger! Cheers to Neaterize for debuting the modern take on what is the universally conventional hanger design! Instead of the customary notches that can pull, tear & restrain access, this velvet hanger is exclusively designed with two custom hooks. The Neaterize velvet hanger has no match or mimic on the market! ⭐ QUALITY THAT STAYS HANGING! Our company’s priority? Performance! Our mission? Keep those hangers up & running! Heavy-duty plastic & a sturdy metal hook means lasting and long-term closet fixtures, intended to hold bulky winterwear. Featuring swivel hanger hooks that offer flexibility & reduce breakage, this is one hanger that won’t crack under pressure! ⭐ CHIC CLOSET COMPANIONS! Practical, productive & full of pizzazz! The Neaterize velvet hangers do more than store your clothes, they utterly transform your storage space from functional to fabulous, mundane to magazine worthy. Alter any room with these trendy, coordinating non slip velvet hangers, making your closet the celebrity of home décor! ⭐ CHOOSE, USE & RE-USE! Slim, sleek & space saving, our hangers take up minimal space, maximizing storing capacity. Thin appearance notwithstanding, don’t be afraid to pile it on! These closet hangers Measure at 17.5\"x 9\"x .2\" and they hang it all! The ultimate wardrobe organizers; sorting clothing, suits, pants, coats, sweaters, dresses, evening gowns & outerwear while accessories stay in their in place on convenient hooks that don't leave any marks! ⭐ RISK-FREE PURCHASE? Absolutely! Either fall in love with your velvet clothes hangers or receive a Full Refund- No Questions Asked! Your positive experience is with our felt clothes hanger matters most to us, which is why we eagerly await to hear your feedback. Please reach out to our team with any questions, concerns, or comments. Your satisfaction is ours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810o1lXxmrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEATERIZE","source_asin":"B0C5Y4CR9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-185965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5Y4CR9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5Y4CR9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
